      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel like `vma_shares_pagetables()` is not really needed. You can call `vma_ptshare_desc()` instead and check for result to be non-NULL. This saves one READ_ONCE():\n\n```\nstatic inline struct ptshare_desc *vma_ptshare_desc(const struct vm_area_struct *vma)\n{\n\tstruct ptshare_desc *desc;\n\n\tif (VM_WARN_ON_ONCE_VMA(!vma_is_ptshare_client(vma), vma))\n\t\treturn NULL;\n\n\tdesc \u003d READ_ONCE(vma-\u003e__vm_ptshare_desc);\n\tVM_WARN_ON_ONCE_VMA(!desc, vma)\n\n\treturn desc;\n}\n```",
